WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,460
There are less than three months left until the end of the world

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,960
Don't waste every minute

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,460
Work is optional

4
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:15,000
But supplies must be stocked up before everyone reacts. Xiao Shen

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,060
I just saw your resignation letter

6
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,240
Why did you call in sick so early in the morning?

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,740
Now I have to resign again

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,240
Is there something wrong with your body?

9
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,240
Manager Liu

10
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,740
I went to the hospital for a checkup today

11
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,740
The doctor said long-term mental stress

12
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,740
If you continue like this, your body will have problems.

13
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,240
I'm going to take a few months off

14
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,740
Take the kids to live in Nanshi for a while

15
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,740
Since it is a physical reason

16
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,240
It’s not easy for me to force you to stay.

17
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,240
But you are the supervisor

18
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,240
Sudden resignation

19
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:39,940
I'll find someone to take over your job soon.

20
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,940
Liu Jingjing in our team has good business ability

21
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:42,940
Work steadily

22
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,940
He has been following the recent projects very well.

23
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,440
If you are willing to focus on cultivating

24
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:47,940
It should be fine for him to take my job.

25
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:51,030
Xiao Liu has really made a lot of progress recently

26
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,530
Thanks to you for always treating him

27
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:54,040
So be it

28
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,040
You come to the company tomorrow

29
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,540
Handled resignation and work handover

30
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,540
I'll try to walk as fast as possible for you here.

31
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,540
Thank you, Manager Liu

32
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:00,540
Then I'll go there tomorrow morning

33
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,490
If there is no apocalypse

34
00:01:02,490 --> 00:01:03,990
This job pays well

35
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:05,490
I really can't bear to say goodbye

36
00:01:05,490 --> 00:01:06,490
But after three months

37
00:01:06,490 --> 00:01:07,490
No matter how high the salary is

38
00:01:07,490 --> 00:01:19,050
I can't buy it. It tastes so sweet in one bite.

39
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:21,050
I almost forgot what fruit tastes like

40
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:22,050
late apocalypse

41
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:23,050
fresh fruits and vegetables

42
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:25,050
Only those at the top of the base can afford it

43
00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:27,080
This time I have to swallow more of what I say.

44
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:31,490
Bank 118,000

45
00:01:31,490 --> 00:01:33,490
All funds and short-term financial management are fully refunded

46
00:01:33,490 --> 00:01:34,990
About 430,000

47
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:37,440
Accident insurance compensation left by parents

48
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,440
There are 1.3 million more

49
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,440
Has not moved

50
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,600
add up

51
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,100
It can be mobilized immediately now

52
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:43,600
There are 1.73 million

53
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:46,020
The apartment I live in now is 92 square meters.

54
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:48,020
My parents bought it for a total of 1.8 million yuan.

55
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,520
There is another set in the old town

56
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,020
120 square meters school district room

57
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:53,020
It shouldn’t be difficult to sell for four million now

58
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:55,390
Parents back then

59
00:01:55,390 --> 00:01:57,390
I have even thought about which primary school my children will go to in the future.

60
00:01:57,390 --> 00:01:59,390
It's a pity that they didn't even have time to meet Momo

61
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:02,060
Half a year after my parents died in a car accident

62
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:03,060
I decided to take care of things myself

63
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:05,060
Ten months pregnant with Mo Mo

64
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:07,060
I just wanted to live a good life with her

65
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:09,060
Who would have thought that in three years it would be the end of the world?

66
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:16,700
And me and silent insurance

67
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,700
I paid 160,000

68
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:18,700
I silently paid 60,000 yuan

69
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,700
Although you will lose money if you surrender your policy early

70
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:20,700
But when the end comes

71
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:21,700
These insurance policies are worse than scrap paper

72
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:23,700
How much can you get back?
